{
 "number": 28,
 "title": "Add gh CLI support for PR creation in Tasks",
 "body": "## Summary\n- Install GitHub CLI (`gh`) in the claude-code container image\n- Add `GitHubConfig` to the `Workspace` API type to reference a secret containing `GH_TOKEN`\n- Inject `GH_TOKEN` env var into the main container (not the init container) when `workspace.github` is configured\n- Add `githubToken` field to the CLI config file, which auto-creates the Kubernetes secret and attaches it to the Task\n- Display GitHub secret info in `axon get` output\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `go vet ./...` passes\n- [x] `make build` succeeds\n- [x] `make test` passes\n- [x] `make test-integration` passes (5/5 specs, including new GitHub config test)\n- [x] `make image` builds successfully, `gh` v2.86.0 confirmed in claude-code image\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nAdds GitHub CLI support to Tasks to enable PR creation. Installs gh and injects GITHUB_TOKEN and GH_TOKEN from a Kubernetes secret into both the init and main containers.\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Install gh in the claude-code image.\n  - Simplify API: use workspace.secretRef to reference GITHUB_TOKEN.\n  - Inject GITHUB_TOKEN and GH_TOKEN into init and main containers.\n  - CLI supports workspace.token; auto-creates the axon-workspace-credentials secret, attaches it to the Task, and shows it in axon get.\n\n- **Migration**\n  - To enable: set workspace.token in the CLI config, or create a secret with key GITHUB_TOKEN and set workspace.secretRef.name to it. Existing tasks are unaffected.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 3ff12d0b4515ae2af7b189c2924a823d9fa4c2dc. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n",
